{
  "name": "imm3d",
  "description": "imm3d is an exploratory Rust library designed for immediate-mode 3D graphics programming, providing a streamlined imperative interface for rendering spatial primitives. By abstracting the complexities of retained-mode graphics pipelines, the project facilitates rapid prototyping and direct visualization through a simplified API. It currently serves as a minimal scaffold for implementing lightweight 3D rendering routines suitable for systems-level diagnostics and tooling.",
